s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.poster.avif?t=1754600896\" width=630 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.webm?t=1754600896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/be999223b010354fbf9d07f92f8aa51d.mp4?t=1754600896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>challenges</strong>. There are <strong>collectibles</strong>\u00a0and other secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.poster.avif?t=1754600896\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.webm?t=1754600896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/bf72d579258c40a3eadf36af7b203951.mp4?t=1754600896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
